OL,3,AChancellor to say UK economy 'turning a
OL,4,Acorner' despite debt concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chancellor is set to give an upbeat
OL,7,Fview of the state of the UK economy
OL,8,Fahead of next month's Budget, building
OL,9,Fon a recent uptick in consumer and
OL,10,Fbusiness confidence.
OL,12,FIn a speech on Monday, John Healey will
OL,13,Ftalk of a "new story" of the economy
OL,14,Fnot just turning a corner, but being
OL,15,Fresilient, optimistic and "ready to
OL,16,Fseize the opportunities of new
OL,17,Ftechnologies and ideas".
OL,19,FHe will also unveil a #150m fund for
OL,20,Fcompanies in the north of England.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
